  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8243;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math><br />As <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mn>1</mn> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow> </math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math><br />Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> is the other point of extrema.</p>",
    "image": null
